---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import About from "../components/About.astro";
import Theme from "../components/Theme.astro";
import Story from "../components/Story.astro";
import Cast from "../components/Cast.astro";
import EventInfo from "../components/EventInfo.astro";
import Ticket from "../components/Ticket.astro";
import Notices from "../components/Notices.astro";
import Access from "../components/Access.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import StoryText from "../components/storyText.astro"
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>第26回 和太鼓 早春の陣</title>
  </head>
  <body class="overflow-x-hidden">
	<Header />
	<Hero />
	<StoryText>
  		四季がなくなってしまった世界
		<br/><br/><br/>
		ある日から雲が空を覆い尽くし、夜が永遠に続くようになりました
	</StoryText>
	<StoryText>
		日が差すどこかに、春を呼ぶ鈴があるらしい
		<br/><br/><br/>
		旅人らはすっかり冷え込んだ町を出て行き、春を呼ぶ鈴を探しにいきました ───
	</StoryText>
	<Footer />
  </body>
</html>